<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 25-MAR.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 25-MAR.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Justin is dissipating off the coast of Queensland is becoming less and less of a threat to shipping. Top winds are near 35 mph. Justin will likely be fully dissipated by 12 hours. Areas along the north coast of Queensland continue recover from flooding in association with Justin over the weekend.  </p>
<p>There are no further emergency statements at this time.</p>
</text>
